<%= @changing ? "CONFIRM YOUR NEW ADDRESS" : "CONFIRM YOUR ADDRESS" %>

<% if @changing -%>
Open this to move your Prachar account to <%= @email %>. Nothing changes
until you do.
<% else -%>
Open this to confirm that you can read <%= @email %>.
<% end -%>

<%= @url %>

This matters because it is where we send a link if you ever forget your
password. An address nobody can read means no way back into your account.

This link works once, and for three days.
